    .DESCRIPTION
        Vuln ID    : V-238121
        STIG ID    : DTOO104
        Rule ID    : SV-238121r961092_rule
        CCI ID     : CCI-001170
        Rule Name  : SRG-APP-000210
        Rule Title : Disabling of user name and password syntax from being used in URLs must be enforced.
